o@BrooklynParamount.com to reserve accommodations. Balcony Includes: Exclus
 
ive Entrance via Dekalb Ave. Balcony Access Private Bar Private Bathrooms P
 
rivate Coat Check Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/lawrence-sta
 
