DESCRIPTION:In the 1800s\, taxidermy was displayed @ world expos\, filling 
 
the public w/ awe. Wunderkammer continues this tradition\, but w/ a modern 
 
focus on sustainability\, inclusivity & creativity. Join us as the nation's
 
 most innovative taxidermy artists display their creative creatures in a sh
 
owcase of the beautifully bizarre. Each ticket includes a gift\, sponsored 
 
by Bazaar Baltimore. To ensure a safe night\, please take a moment to revie
 
w our restricted items. While we love Halloween costumes\, we don't allow a
 
ny identity-concealing face paint/masks\, weapons/replicas of weapons\, sha
 
rp jewelry\, clothing that may cause harm & stuffed animals/toys. No outsid
 
e food/drink. Door Time: 7pm (front bar opens: 6pm). Show Time: 8pm. 21 & o
 
ver w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. *General Admission standing & se
 
ating. **Seating 1st come\, 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for b
 
est selection. If you have an accessibility request\, please email thebellh
 
ouse@livenation.com prior. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/wun
 
